 "captions": [
  {
   "from": 6,
   "to": 76,
   "text": "Medieval maps did not say \"here be dragons\"."
  },
  {
   "from": 78,
   "to": 168,
   "text": "That phrase appears on exactly one known object:"
  },
  {
   "from": 169,
   "to": 283,
   "text": "a copper globe the size of a grapefruit, from the early 1500s."
  },
  {
   "from": 285,
   "to": 341,
   "text": "In 1855, an architect bought it in Paris for"
  },
  {
   "from": 343,
   "to": 439,
   "text": "almost nothing, and gave it to his kids as a toy."
  },
  {
   "from": 441,
   "to": 485,
   "text": "And medieval dragons?"
  },
  {
   "from": 487,
   "to": 567,
   "text": "In their encyclopedias, a dragon's power wasn't in its teeth."
  },
  {
   "from": 568,
   "to": 610,
   "text": "It was in its tail."
  },
  {
   "from": 611,
   "to": 673,
   "text": "It waited on elephant paths,"
  },
  {
   "from": 674,
   "to": 759,
   "text": "wrapped its tail around their legs, and squeezed."
  },
  {
   "from": 761,
   "to": 798,
   "text": "In 793, English chroniclers recorded \"fiery"
  },
  {
   "from": 799,
   "to": 867,
   "text": "dragons flying across the firmament\"."
  },
  {
   "from": 869,
   "to": 927,
   "text": "Soon after, the Vikings struck Lindisfarne."
  },
  {
   "from": 929,
   "to": 978,
   "text": "And around 1335, an Austrian town"
  },
  {
   "from": 979,
   "to": 1026,
   "text": "put a dragon's skull on display."
  },
  {
   "from": 1027,
   "to": 1074,
   "text": "It was a woolly rhino."
  },
  {
   "from": 1075,
   "to": 1151,
   "text": "The full story is on my channel."
  }
 ],
